From 57544f37fcfda2c21eefd9edbcd95b94211ab409 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] lotus_v2: remove SmtNode script_pubkey dual-state and add
 legacy-to-v7 adapter

Unify SmtNode on pure v7 BranchOutput representation without redundant
legacy script_pubkey storage and provide a boundary adapter for legacy
unit test fixtures.
